Z||000050||grinthock||08-06-2001||03:20 PM||||Well if you want to run Secuity check out GOTCHA! web cam software, it has a mode where it WATCHES for movement then starts recording, it works VERY VERY well, doesn't false when tree's move, or stuff falls, and the sensitivity is adjustable, you can use it for indoor/outdoor too... Just get a cheap cam and goto town. GET A CCD CAM!! Do NOT get a cam with a CMOS sensor in it (That's the actual thing that captures the light) the CMOS ones look like crap, and have terrible white balance, the one I have now is an OLD CCD cam.<P>Look into the XCAM's by X10 they are good, and are cheap too, I can get them here for $90 Canadian.<P>Cam went down today, machien crashed, I am out of town (Hence the fiero aint there!!) so I will try to reboot right now but you may find that gosh, the car STILL aint there!||||reg||10
